//| named_of 'main.ft:12': 0
//| named_of '': 0
//| named_of 'main.ft:0:5: leak': 0
//| named_of 'main.ft:1000000:5: leak': 0
//| reports_at: the lines 2 to 7: 0 1 3 0 2 0, another file 0, no report line 0
//| rule overwrite on the lines 2 to 7: EEWEWE, another file EEEEEE
//| rule leak on the lines 2 to 7: ELLEEE, another file EEEEEE
//| rule leak at exit on the lines 2 to 7: ELLEEE, another file EEEEEE
